  <p id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p001:m0000" ref="z7z_9c4_gj0">孫</persName>修華生廬陵孝獻王<persName id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p001:m0009" ref="4ly_56b_ld0">義真</persName></p>
  <p id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">可追復先封，特遣奉迎，并<persName id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p002:m0012" ref="z7z_9c4_gj0">孫</persName>修華、<persName id="c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p002:m0016" ref="lnx_xbi_k90">謝</persName>妃一時俱還。</p>
</text>
